## Real-World Example from This Project

**Bug:** System messages from AI actions (confirm, undo) were not persisting after page refresh.

**Root Cause:**
```typescript
// WRONG
setMessages(prev => prev.map(updateAction));
const updatedMessages = [...messages, systemMessage]; // Stale!
await saveConversation(updatedMessages);
```

**Fix:**
```typescript
// CORRECT
let finalMessages: ChatMessage[] = [];
setMessages(prev => {
  const updated = prev.map(updateAction);
  const final = [...updated, systemMessage];
  finalMessages = final;
  return final;
});
await saveConversation(finalMessages);
```

